1:["$","main",null,{"className":"site article-page","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"article-frame","children":[["$","$La",null,{"className":"desktop-brand","href":"/","children":"Thinkinghaus"}],["$","article",null,{"className":"article-column","children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"article-header","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"A system for looking"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"August 5, 2026"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"3 minutes"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-body","children":[[["$","p","0-Before I make, I look.",{"children":["Before I make, I look."]}],["$","p","1-I used to confuse looking with collecting. I would open a browser, save fifty images, and call the result research. My collection grew, my understanding did not.",{"children":["I used to confuse looking with collecting. I would open a browser, save fifty images, and call the result research. My collection grew, my understanding did not."]}],["$","p","2-Now I try to begin with a question. What am I actually trying to understand? What has become so familiar that no one sees it anymore? What does a person need to know, feel, or do—and in what order? The question does not need to point toward an answer. It only needs to give my looking a shape.",{"children":["Now I try to begin with a question. What am I actually trying to understand? What has become so familiar that no one sees it anymore? What does a person need to know, feel, or do—and in what order? The question does not need to point toward an answer. It only needs to give my looking a shape."]}],["$","p","3-I start near the subject. If I am working on a corporate report, I look at reports. I need to understand the form before I decide what to do with it.",{"children":["I start near the subject. If I am working on a corporate report, I look at reports. I need to understand the form before I decide what to do with it."]}],["$","p","4-Then I move farther away. I might look at newspapers, maps, instruction manuals, or paintings. A newspaper knows how to handle density. A map knows how to hold several scales at once. A painting may know something useful about directing the eye.",{"children":["Then I move farther away. I might look at newspapers, maps, instruction manuals, or paintings. A newspaper knows how to handle density. A map knows how to hold several scales at once. A painting may know something useful about directing the eye."]}],["$","p","5-I am not looking for a style to borrow. I am trying to notice what something is doing. When I save a reference, I write down why.  The note is as at least as useful as the image. It gives me enough distance to carry the idea somewhere else without copying its appearance.",{"children":["I am not looking for a style to borrow. I am trying to notice what something is doing. When I save a reference, I write down why.  The note is as at least as useful as the image. It gives me enough distance to carry the idea somewhere else without copying its appearance."]}],["$","p","6-Then I arrange what I have found and start removing things. One reference tells me what I like. Several references placed together begin to reveal to me what I think. The one that does not fit is often worth keeping around. Or it may be pointing to something the rest of the collection has politely avoided.",{"children":["Then I arrange what I have found and start removing things. One reference tells me what I like. Several references placed together begin to reveal to me what I think. The one that does not fit is often worth keeping around. Or it may be pointing to something the rest of the collection has politely avoided."]}],"$Lb","$Lc","$Ld"],null]}],"$Le"]}]]}]}]
b:["$","p","7-Time helps too. I am easily persuaded by novelty and veneer. If I leave the references alone for a day, some become less convincing, a few become more interesting.",{"children":["Time helps too. I am easily persuaded by novelty and veneer. If I leave the references alone for a day, some become less convincing, a few become more interesting."]}]
c:["$","p","8-Eventually I make something, usually before I feel ready. A rough sketch shows whether an observation can survive contact with actual words, scale, and use. If it can’t, no matter how cute it is, it gets tossed off the cliff.",{"children":["Eventually I make something, usually before I feel ready. A rough sketch shows whether an observation can survive contact with actual words, scale, and use. If it can’t, no matter how cute it is, it gets tossed off the cliff."]}]
d:["$","p","9-So my system is not very complicated: begin with a question, look outside the category, name what matters, arrange, remove, make, and look again. The point is not to build an impressive moodboard. It is to notice enough that a decision becomes easier.",{"children":["So my system is not very complicated: begin with a question, look outside the category, name what matters, arrange, remove, make, and look again. The point is not to build an impressive moodboard. It is to notice enough that a decision becomes easier."]}]
